; Two deprecations with nothing standing in their place. The first claim wrote
; an id and the second did not, which is the difference between a diagnostic
; which can name the claim and one which has to say what it was about.
;
; This is the file the rule exists for: written as it is, deprecated is a delete
; button, and the record of why the number changed is gone the moment somebody
; asks what the model says.
